' ===========================================================================
' Adapter interfaces
' ===========================================================================
interface ServiceAdapter {
    + {abstract} execute(params: BaseModel, idempotency_key: str): StandardResult
    + {abstract} compensate(transaction_id: str): StandardResult
    + {abstract} normalize(native_response: dict, idempotency_key: str): StandardResult
}

class ResidentAdapter {
    + register(params, key): StandardResult
    + cancel(transaction_id): StandardResult
    - normalize(response, key): StandardResult
}

class TransportAdapter {
    + register_vehicle(params, key): StandardResult
    + book_parking(params, key): StandardResult
    + cancel_vehicle(transaction_id): StandardResult
    + cancel_parking(transaction_id): StandardResult
    - normalize(response, key): StandardResult
}

class PaymentAdapter {
    + charge(params, key): StandardResult
    + refund(transaction_id): StandardResult
    - normalize(response, key): StandardResult
}

ServiceAdapter <|.. ResidentAdapter
ServiceAdapter <|.. TransportAdapter
ServiceAdapter <|.. PaymentAdapter

' ===========================================================================
' Notes
' ===========================================================================
note right of TaskPlan
  **TaskPlan validation:**
  • Schema: Pydantic parse
  • Allowlist: tool ∈ {4 tools}
  • Unique IDs: len(set) == len(list)
  • Valid refs: depends_on ⊆ task_ids
  • No cycles: topological sort OK
  • No compensation tools in plan
end note

note left of StandardResult
  **Service contract:**
  Mọi service response được
  normalize thành StandardResult.
  Executor chỉ đọc result.success (boolean).
  transaction_id nullable: null nếu service
  chưa tạo transaction (ví dụ: NO_AVAILABILITY).
end note

note right of TOOL_REGISTRY
  **Tool metadata:**
  Không có Service Tool runtime class.
  Tool metadata (schema, action_type,
  compensation_fn) sống trong ToolEntry.
  Runtime call: Executor → Registry → Adapter.
end note

note bottom of ServiceAdapter
  **Adapter layer:**
  Layer duy nhất thay đổi khi
  chuyển từ mock → real API.
  Translate typed params → HTTP request.
  Normalize native response → StandardResult.
  Attach idempotency_key vào mọi request.
end note

@enduml
